** SYNTHETIC CONTROLLED STEADY-STATE EXPERIMENT; NOT OBSERVED WEATHER.
** Fixed weather in every hour; source emissions are an illustrative assumption.
** Deposition POSTFILE values are one-hour amounts in ug/m2, numerically ug/m2/h.
CO STARTING
CO TITLEONE Controlled steady-state Clemson microplastic plume
CO TITLETWO u2_r1 DDEP synthetic 2024-07-15
CO MODELOPT DFAULT DDEP DRYDPLT WETDPLT
CO AVERTIME 1 PERIOD
CO POLLUTID AMP
CO RUNORNOT RUN
CO ERRORFIL errors.out
CO FINISHED

SO STARTING
SO INCLUDED ../../../aermap/aermap.src
SO SRCPARAM AMPAREA 1.15740740741e-08 2 100 100 0.0 1
SO PARTDIAM AMPAREA 5
SO MASSFRAX AMPAREA 1.0
SO PARTDENS AMPAREA 1.234
SO CONCUNIT 1.0E6 GRAMS/SEC MICROGRAMS/M3
SO DEPOUNIT 3.6E9 GRAMS/SEC MICROGRAMS/M2
SO SRCGROUP ALL
SO FINISHED

RE STARTING
RE INCLUDED ../../../aermap/aermap.rec
RE FINISHED

ME STARTING
ME SURFFILE ../../../aermet/u2_r1.sfc
ME PROFFILE ../../../aermet/u2_r1.pfl
ME SURFDATA 99999 2024 SYNTHETIC
ME UAIRDATA 99999999 2024 SYNTHETIC
ME PROFBASE 211.44 METERS
ME STARTEND 2024 7 15 1 2024 7 15 24
ME FINISHED

OU STARTING
OU FILEFORM EXP
OU RECTABLE 1 FIRST
OU PLOTFILE PERIOD ALL annual.plt
OU PLOTFILE 1 ALL FIRST max1h.plt
OU POSTFILE 1 ALL PLOT hourly.plt
OU SUMMFILE aermod.sum
OU FINISHED
